1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,575
Someone texts you,

2
00:00:01,725 --> 00:00:04,399
I had a really good time tonight.

3
00:00:04,899 --> 00:00:09,062
And now you're rewriting the same reply, five times.

4
00:00:09,212 --> 00:00:10,664
Too eager?

5
00:00:10,814 --> 00:00:12,277
Too dry?

6
00:00:12,427 --> 00:00:13,876
You know what you mean.

7
00:00:14,026 --> 00:00:16,459
You just can't find the words.

8
00:00:16,609 --> 00:00:20,151
Imagine pasting their message into ReplyRight,

9
00:00:20,301 --> 00:00:22,373
picking warm and confident,

10
00:00:22,523 --> 00:00:26,009
and getting a reply that actually sounds like you.

11
00:00:26,409 --> 00:00:28,078
I had a great time too.

12
00:00:28,228 --> 00:00:30,546
I'd love to see you again.

13
00:00:33,846 --> 00:00:35,353
Want early access?

14
00:00:35,503 --> 00:00:37,320
Comment REPLY.

